@startuml sd_TCSProvideDcmInfo
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

mainframe SUM_TCS TotalVehicleTimeValue (0xF129)

participant Dcm
participant SUM_SUSD as susd

box SUM_TCS
    participant IRVs as rte
    participant Runnable_TotalVehicleTimeRead as read
    participant Runnable_TotalVehicleTimeCheckRead as check
    participant Runnable_TCS_PermitExecutionShutdown as shutter
end box

== Pre-condition ==

susd -> shutter: request TCS functionalities from interface //SUSD_PermitExecution//
activate shutter
shutter -> rte: set TCS_permit_execution = TRUE
deactivate shutter

== Sequence fulfill ==

note over read: Read service operation

Dcm -> read: //ReadData()// from by interface //DataServices_<Configurable>// 
activate read
read -> read: read TCS_TotalVehicleTimeValue
read --> Dcm: return the value of TCS_TotalVehicleTimeValue
deactivate read

note over check: Operation check service operation

Dcm -> check: //ConditionCheckRead()// from by interface //DataServices_<Configurable>//
activate check
check -> check: Set Error status
check --> Dcm: return the value of Error
deactivate check

@enduml